Package: scan-to-img
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Andrej Georgievski <6819247+bespoke-code@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxinerama1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libegl1, libgl1, libvulkan1, libfontconfig1
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers, libgl1-mesa-dri
Description: Stitch and invert film scans
 Scan to image turns overlapping digital-camera scans of film negatives
 into one clean positive image. It stitches up to 16 frames, supports
 cropping and tone adjustments, and exports PNG, JPEG, TIFF, WebP or BMP.
